#: ../../source/architecture.md:3
msgid ""
"q2m3 separates classical chemistry, quantum circuits, MC sampling, and diagnostics. PySCF, NumPy,"
" PennyLane, JAX, and Catalyst require different data formats and execution conditions."
msgstr "q2m3 将经典化学、量子电路、MC 采样和诊断分开。PySCF、NumPy、PennyLane、JAX 和 Catalyst 各有不同的数据格式和执行条件。"

