#: ../../source/architecture.md:35
msgid "Data Flow"
msgstr "数据流"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:37
msgid ""
"The main workflow converts molecular data to a qubit Hamiltonian. QPE or a fallback solver then "
"supplies data for classical observables."
msgstr "主要工作流将分子数据转换为量子比特哈密顿量，再通过 QPE 或后备求解器为经典可观测量提供数据。"

