#: ../../source/architecture.md:80
msgid ""
"`device_type=\"auto\"` selects the best available PennyLane device for standard execution. "
"Catalyst execution still depends on the effective JAX/Catalyst backend. A Lightning GPU device "
"name therefore does not by itself prove that compiled execution runs on the GPU."
msgstr ""
"`device_type=\"auto\"` 为标准执行选择当前最合适的 PennyLane 设备。Catalyst 执行仍取决于实际的 JAX/Catalyst 后端。因此，仅有 "
"Lightning GPU 设备名称不能证明编译后的执行使用 GPU。"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:85
msgid "Catalyst And IR Cache"
msgstr "Catalyst 与 IR 缓存"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:87
msgid ""
"The solvation package treats Catalyst as a compile-once/reuse-many tool. Catalyst compiles the "
"QPE circuit topology once. The solvation package then supplies fixed or runtime Hamiltonian "
"coefficients across MC steps. The IR cache stores Catalyst LLVM IR for reuse when the structural "
"cache key does not change."
msgstr ""
"溶剂化软件包将 Catalyst 用于编译一次、多次复用。Catalyst 编译一次 QPE 电路拓扑，溶剂化软件包随后在 MC 步骤中提供固定或运行时哈密顿量系数。当结构缓存键不变时，IR "
"缓存可复用存储的 Catalyst LLVM IR。"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:92
msgid ""
"The cache key records the molecule, basis, active space, QPE wire count, Trotter depth, and "
"circuit style. Runtime solvent coordinates and the number of waters do not change the circuit "
"topology in the same way. `embedding_mode` is also part of the key because `full_oneelectron` "
"fixed-MO embedding can introduce off-diagonal one-electron operator support that is not present "
"in a diagonal coefficient update."
msgstr ""
"缓存键记录分子、基组、活性空间、QPE 线路数、Trotter 深度和电路形式。运行时溶剂坐标和水分子数不会以相同方式改变电路拓扑。`embedding_mode` 也属于缓存键，因为 "
"`full_oneelectron` 固定分子轨道嵌入可能引入非对角单电子算符支撑，而对角系数更新中没有这些支撑。"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:99
msgid "SQD Execution Boundary"
msgstr "SQD 执行边界"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:101
msgid ""
"SQD is optional and does not use QPE or Catalyst. The geometry entry builds a vacuum RHF frame, "
"active-space integrals, and a same-frame CCSD seed. It then executes the same integral-based "
"solver that the lower-level entry point uses."
msgstr "SQD 是可选路径，不使用 QPE 或 Catalyst。几何入口构建真空 RHF 轨道框架、活性空间积分及同框架的 CCSD 种子，然后执行与底层入口相同的积分求解器。"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:126
msgid ""
"Both entries run under one wall deadline and a polled process-tree RSS cap. The geometry entry "
"includes integral and seed assembly inside that supervised engine call. A caller that assembles "
"integrals before invoking `run_sqd_from_integrals` must monitor that preprocessing separately. "
"The calibrated executor supports Linux x86_64, serial native threads, balanced closed-shell "
"spaces, and the exact dependency/profile bounds recorded in `resource_calibration.json`."
msgstr ""
"两个入口都受统一的实际时间截止点和轮询进程树 RSS 上限约束。几何入口将积分与种子组装包含在受监督的引擎调用内。如果调用者先组装积分，再调用 "
"`run_sqd_from_integrals`，则必须单独监测该预处理。校准执行器支持 Linux x86_64、串行原生线程、平衡闭壳层空间，以及 "
"`resource_calibration.json` 记录的精确依赖和配置边界。"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:133
msgid ""
"The orbital frame and Hamiltonian have separate SHA256 identities. SQD accepts an integral run "
"only when `IntegralContext`, `CCSDSeed`, tensor shapes, permutation symmetries, constants, "
"energies, and residuals agree. These checks prevent the solver from silently reusing amplitudes "
"or energies from a different frame."
msgstr ""
"轨道框架和哈密顿量各有独立的 SHA256 标识。只有 `IntegralContext`、`CCSDSeed`、张量形状、置换对称性、常数、能量和残差相互一致时，SQD "
"才接受积分运行。这些检查防止求解器静默复用其他轨道框架的振幅或能量。"

