#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Mark H3O+ and 8-bit workflows as diagnostics"
msgstr "将 H3O+ 和 8 位工作流标为诊断"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "They are useful but can exceed laptop memory limits"
msgstr "它们有诊断价值，但可能超出笔记本内存限制"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Use active spaces explicitly"
msgstr "显式使用活性空间"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Every energy result needs a clear electron/orbital/qubit context"
msgstr "每项能量结果都需要明确的电子数、轨道数和量子比特数"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Keep energies in Hartree internally"
msgstr "内部能量保持使用 Hartree"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Unit conversion is visible and avoids mixed-unit mistakes"
msgstr "显式转换单位，避免混用单位"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Preserve classical fallback paths"
msgstr "保留经典后备路径"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "They test QM/MM plumbing when quantum execution is unavailable"
msgstr "量子执行不可用时，它们可测试 QM/MM 数据连接"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Separate sampling from quantum execution"
msgstr "将采样与量子执行分开"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "MC proposal logic remains testable without Catalyst"
msgstr "无须 Catalyst 也能测试 MC 提议逻辑"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Keep full-one-electron embedding fixed-only"
msgstr "完整单电子嵌入仅用于固定哈密顿量"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid ""
"Runtime coefficient updates are diagonal-only. Full active-space `Delta h_pq` changes operator "
