msgstr "运行时仅更新对角系数。完整活性空间 `Delta h_pq` 会改变算符支撑"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Keep SQD optional and lazy"
msgstr "SQD 保持可选并按需加载"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid ""
"Core and configuration imports do not require ffsim or Qiskit. Workflow access gives an "
"installation hint when the extra is absent"
msgstr "导入核心和配置不要求 ffsim 或 Qiskit。缺少可选依赖时，访问工作流会提供安装提示"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Authenticate integral SQD inputs"
msgstr "认证积分 SQD 输入"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid ""
"Frame and Hamiltonian hashes keep CCSD seeds, integrals, core constants, and results on one "
"auditable Hamiltonian"
msgstr "轨道框架和哈密顿量哈希使 CCSD 种子、积分、核心常数和结果对应同一个可审计的哈密顿量"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid "Reject resource extrapolation"
msgstr "拒绝资源外推"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:106
msgid ""
"A calibrated bound is safer than treating `allow_large` as permission to bypass unknown or hard "
"limits"
msgstr "使用校准边界，比将 `allow_large` 视为可绕过未知限制或硬限制的许可更安全"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:154
msgid "Extension Points"
msgstr "扩展点"

#: ../../source/architecture.md:156
msgid ""
"`q2m3.core.quantum_solver` defines a conservative solver abstraction for future algorithms such "
"as VQE or QAOA. Current public workflows still route primarily through `QPEEngine` and "
"`QuantumQMMM`. The solver abstraction supports future extensions. It does not yet replace the "
"integrated execution path."
msgstr ""
"`q2m3.core.quantum_solver` 为 VQE 或 QAOA 等未来算法定义保守的求解器抽象。当前公开工作流仍主要通过 `QPEEngine` 和 `QuantumQMMM` "
"执行。该抽象支持未来扩展，尚不能替代集成执行路径。"
